---
layout: layout.html
title: "Zero Waste Cooking Blog"
description: "First-person stories about cooking better from fridge staples."
permalink: /blog.html
---
<section class="pg-hero">
  <h1>The MyFridgeDinner Kitchen Journal</h1>
  <p>First-person stories about cooking smarter from what you already have. Zero waste, real kitchens, honest technique.</p>
</section>

<main id="main-content">
  <div class="sec-div"></div>
  <div style="max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 clamp(14px,4vw,32px)"><p class="more-lbl">Latest Stories</p></div>
  
  <div class="blog-grid">
    {%- for post in collections.post | reverse -%}
    <article class="b-card">
      <div class="b-img">
        <img src="{{ post.data.image }}" alt="{{ post.data.title }}" loading="lazy" onerror="this.style.display='none';this.nextElementSibling.style.display='flex'">
        <div class="bf" aria-hidden="true">🍳</div>
      </div>
      <div class="b-body">
        <span class="b-cat">{{ post.data.category }}</span>
        <h3>{{ post.data.title }}</h3>
        <div class="b-meta">
          <span>📅 {{ post.data.display_date }}</span>
          <span>⏱ {{ post.data.read_time }}</span>
        </div>
        <p>{{ post.data.description }}</p>
        <a href="{{ post.url }}" class="btn-rd">Read the Story →</a>
      </div>
    </article>
    {%- endfor -%}
  </div>
</main>
